{"repo": {"timestamp": 1782379054000, "categories": {"Time": {"name": {"en-US": "Time"}}}}, "packages": {"com.freedomfighter.retreattimer": {"metadata": {"added": 1782379054000, "categories": ["Time"], "lastUpdated": 1782379054000, "license": "MIT", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/funkypitt/retreat-timer", "authorName": "funkypitt", "name": {"en-US": "Retreat Timer"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Rings three meditation bells on schedule, even in deep sleep"}, "description": {"en-US": "Retreat Timer rings a recording of three singing-bowl bells at the times of day\nyou choose — the signal to begin or end a sitting — so a meditation retreat\nkeeps running on schedule even when the teacher is not present.\n\nBuilt for one job: the bells ring no matter what.\n\n* Exact alarms via the same mechanism the stock Clock app uses, so they fire on\n  time even when the device is locked, asleep, or in Doze for hours.\n* A foreground service holds a wake lock and plays through the alarm stream, so\n  the system cannot mute or kill the bells mid-ring.\n* Alarms are re-armed automatically after a reboot, time change, or app update.\n* A readiness light turns green once battery optimisation and notifications are\n  set, so the teacher can leave knowing the schedule is safe.\n\nEasy to set up:\n\n* Tap + to add the next bell exactly one hour after the last (07:45 then 08:45).\n* Tap any time to edit it; toggle bells on or off; delete with one tap.\n* Per-bell and global Test buttons play the bells at the exact volume the room\n  will hear, set with a slider.\n\nNo ads, no tracking, no accounts. The schedule repeats every day.\n"}, "preferredSigner": "9b6ae69650b1ccf5bfa08ad15dc8b412622b8e5a3202ea066215067897a2be28"}, "versions": {"9bc7a4bd3a0def7bbd0f0e48600e0e871292fc438f1432422028d61e5821b904": {"added": 1782379054000, "file": {"name": "/RetreatTimer-v1.0.0.apk", "sha256": "9bc7a4bd3a0def7bbd0f0e48600e0e871292fc438f1432422028d61e5821b904", "size": 16825678}, "manifest": {"nativecode": [